		"frame_eqs_eel": "warp = 0;\n\ntic = min(time-tin,.1);\ntin = time;\n\nvol = (bass_att + treb_att + mid_att)*.333333;\n\nra = 1/tic*.25;\n\ntreb_avg = tic*(treb_avg*(1/tic - ra) + ra*treb);\nmid_avg = tic*(mid_avg*(1/tic - ra) + ra*mid);\nbass_avg = tic*(bass_avg*(1/tic - ra) + ra*bass);\nvav = tic*(vav*(1/tic - ra) + ra*(bass+treb+mid)*.33333);\n\ntt = tt + tic*treb;\nmt = mt + tic*mid;\nbt = bt + tic*bass;\nvt = vt + tic*vav;\n\nsp = abs(vav - slide)*.1;\nslide = if(above(slide,vav),slide-tic*sp,slide+tic*sp) + (1-toc)*vav*.2;\ntoc = 1;\n\nq1 = vt*.1;\n\nq2 = .5 + .5*sin(time*4);\n\nq3 = vav*.05; // crossbar sx strength\n\nq4 = vt; // rotation speed",
		"pixel_eqs_eel": "ti = time*-.6;\nrot = sin((rad+ti)*6.2832)*.01;\n\n\n\nmod = .4;\nxsec = above(x,mod)*below(x,1-mod);\nysec = above(y,mod)*below(y,1-mod);\n\nzoom = if(xsec + ysec,zoom,.75);\n\ndx = if(xsec + ysec,dx,.5);\ndy = if(xsec + ysec,dy,.5);\n\nsx = if(xsec + ysec,.9 + q3,1);\n\nmod = (1-2*above(x,.5))*(1-2*above(y,.5));\n\nrot = if(xsec + ysec,rot,q4*mod);",
